  "question": "Within a radius of 160 kilometers, where can I locate university on the journey from John Natsoulas Gallery, Davis, CA to Travelodge by Wyndham Fairfield/Napa Valley, Fairfield, CA?",
  "sql": "WITH\n    angle AS (SELECT degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-121.740978 38.54212)',4326)::geography, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-122.131846 38.218343)',4326)::geography)) AS value)\nSELECT * FROM pois,angle\nWHERE amenity = 'university'\nAND ST_DWithin(pois.geometry, ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-121.740978 38.54212)',4326)::geography, 160000)\nAND (degrees(ST_Azimuth(ST_GeomFromText('POINT (-121.740978 38.54212)',4326)::geography, pois.geometry)) BETWEEN angle.value - 22.5 AND angle.value + 22.5);\n",
